+## 8. Change log
+
+- 2026-11-18 (integrator): plan written.
+- 2026-11-19 (integrator, after the spec review, spec v4.1):
+  - "follows from nothing" is the field `follows_from: nothing` (S-12);
+  - direct(v) for bands and the gate's B.2 comes from the elaborated proof, not the `.ilean` references (S-1, the review's blocker). It needs a facts extension: for every `.holds` theorem and every declaration owned by no card, the constants of its value. 1d (board) and 1e (gate) share it. Today's `directUses` over refs stays only as a fallback while those facts are missing, and then no band gets its ✓;
+  - established requires fresh facts and no TL114 (S-3, S-9);
+  - TL107 loses its coverage exemption (F4);
+  - cycles are checked over drawn and solid arrows (S-14).
+- 2026-11-19 (builder 1a, two kinds): details decided while implementing §2.1–2.4, 2.6 and 2.8 for 1a.
+  - Protocol: `addNode.type`, `kindChange.from`/`to` and `reorder.column` take only AXIOM or PROPOSITION; the old names are refused ("… must be AXIOM or PROPOSITION"). The aliases belong to the markup only.
